-- สถานะโลก: เพื่อนที่ล้ม (เรียงตามความควรไปช่วย) + จำนวนเพื่อน
local WS = {downed = {}, alive = 0, dn = 0}
local episodes = {}
connect(Players.PlayerRemoving, function(p) episodes[p] = nil end)

local function worldStep()
    local m = myRoot()
    local now = tick()
    local downed, alive, dn = {}, 0, 0
    for _, p in ipairs(Players:GetPlayers()) do
        if p ~= lp then
            local ch = p.Character
            local h = ch and ch:FindFirstChildOfClass("Humanoid")
            local r = ch and ch:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart")
            if h and r and h.Health > 0 then
                if isDowned(p) then
                    dn += 1
                    local d = m and (m.Position - r.Position).Magnitude or 0
                    local bd = nearestBot(r.Position)
                    downed[#downed+1] = {plr = p, root = r, dist = d, score = d + ((bd and bd < 60) and 200 or 0)}
                    local ep = episodes[p]
                    if not ep then
                        ep = {t0 = now, att = false}
                        episodes[p] = ep
                        if FLAGS.alert then notify(L("needhelp"), p.DisplayName, 3, true) end
                    end
                    if m and d <= 12 and not ep.att then ep.att = true; S.helps += 1; S.rHelps += 1 end
                else
                    alive += 1
                    local ep = episodes[p]
                    if ep then
                        if ep.att then
                            S.helpOk += 1; S.rOk += 1
                            local dt = now - ep.t0
                            S.lastHelp = dt; S.helpSum += dt
                        end
                        episodes[p] = nil
                    end
                end
            else
                episodes[p] = nil
            end
        end
    end
    table.sort(downed, function(a, b) return a.score < b.score end)
    WS.downed, WS.alive, WS.dn = downed, alive, dn
end
task.spawn(function()
    while gui.Parent do
        pcall(worldStep)
        task.wait(0.15)
    end
end)

